<title>SPAIN: Zaragozano names Cortina, Alcocer chairmen.</title>
<headline>Zaragozano names Cortina, Alcocer chairmen.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Banco Zaragozano's said on Tuesday its board of directors had nominated Alberto Cortina and Alberto Alcocer as joint chairmen.</p>
<p>They were replacing former chairman Jose Ramon Alvarez Rendueles.</p>
<p>The change will be made official at a board meeting, scheduled after the May 10 shareholders' meeting.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
